# ValueTracker -- per-machine development values.
#
# Copy to .env.dev.local, or generate it with:
#   ./scripts/check-env.sh --init-env
#
# .env.dev.local is gitignored because every one of these differs per machine.
# Shared development configuration belongs in .env.dev, which IS committed.
#
# HOST_UID / HOST_GID  the container runs as this user, so files it writes into
#                      the bind-mounted repo are owned by you and not by root.
# DOCKER_GID           the host's docker group, granting the container read
#                      access to the mounted docker socket that Testcontainers
#                      needs. Find it with: getent group docker | cut -d: -f3
HOST_UID=1000
HOST_GID=1000
DOCKER_GID=999
